{"4307420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FORENSIC - M.E. Protocol", "steam_appid": 4307420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/76c343ec65cf2eebc5184198ed91eebf.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=252 /></span><br> <br><strong>DO YOU HAVE AN EYE FOR DETAIL?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forensic M.E. Protocol</strong> puts you in the shoes of a forensic investigator. Your goal is clear: arrive at the scene, find the clues, and decipher what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/11a1ae65cdc7ab0e4740982c6b7c57e8.webp?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 9 distinct scenarios, each with its own beginning and end. From a dark alley to a seemingly quiet neighborhood. No two cases are the same, and each one challenges you to adapt your approach, follow new leads, and connect the dots in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8fc190595fa4dec1843b8c0421711c73.poster.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8fc190595fa4dec1843b8c0421711c73.webm?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8fc190595fa4dec1843b8c0421711c73.mp4?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/fc9b6ce1549f230261855b96c8d513b9.webp?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a child's game. You will encounter crimes of passion, settling of scores, kidnappings, and mature themes. Each scenario tells a dark story that you will have to reconstruct clue by clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/f598c34789b81f9ad7970b5f568e6190.poster.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/f598c34789b81f9ad7970b5f568e6190.webm?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/f598c34789b81f9ad7970b5f568e6190.mp4?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/d352d036233bc42d410d2ae48bee9cb5.webp?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the clue on a roof? Take out the <strong>Drone</strong>. Is there something under the car? Send in the <strong>Ground Robot</strong>. You have many tools at your disposal, and only you decide how to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is as it seems. Or is it? Discovering every little clue is essential to understanding each case. Any detail can change the entire plot, and it won't be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8946cdeeb024da85d7308284b5b49fda.poster.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8946cdeeb024da85d7308284b5b49fda.webm?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8946cdeeb024da85d7308284b5b49fda.mp4?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU SET THE PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no stressful timers or &quot;Game Over&quot; screens. It's just you, your tools, and the mystery. Examine the scene at your own pace, analyze samples, find loose ends. Who is lying and who is telling the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out if you have what it takes to be a forensic detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for your first case?</p>[/b][/b]", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/76c343ec65cf2eebc5184198ed91eebf.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=252 /></span><br> <br><strong>DO YOU HAVE AN EYE FOR DETAIL?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forensic M.E. Protocol</strong> puts you in the shoes of a forensic investigator. Your goal is clear: arrive at the scene, find the clues, and decipher what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/11a1ae65cdc7ab0e4740982c6b7c57e8.webp?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 9 distinct scenarios, each with its own beginning and end. From a dark alley to a seemingly quiet neighborhood. No two cases are the same, and each one challenges you to adapt your approach, follow new leads, and connect the dots in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8fc190595fa4dec1843b8c0421711c73.poster.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8fc190595fa4dec1843b8c0421711c73.webm?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8fc190595fa4dec1843b8c0421711c73.mp4?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/fc9b6ce1549f230261855b96c8d513b9.webp?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a child's game. You will encounter crimes of passion, settling of scores, kidnappings, and mature themes. Each scenario tells a dark story that you will have to reconstruct clue by clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/f598c34789b81f9ad7970b5f568e6190.poster.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/f598c34789b81f9ad7970b5f568e6190.webm?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/f598c34789b81f9ad7970b5f568e6190.mp4?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/d352d036233bc42d410d2ae48bee9cb5.webp?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the clue on a roof? Take out the <strong>Drone</strong>. Is there something under the car? Send in the <strong>Ground Robot</strong>. You have many tools at your disposal, and only you decide how to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is as it seems. Or is it? Discovering every little clue is essential to understanding each case. Any detail can change the entire plot, and it won't be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8946cdeeb024da85d7308284b5b49fda.poster.avif?t=1779963187\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8946cdeeb024da85d7308284b5b49fda.webm?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/extras/8946cdeeb024da85d7308284b5b49fda.mp4?t=1779963187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU SET THE PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no stressful timers or &quot;Game Over&quot; screens. It's just you, your tools, and the mystery. Examine the scene at your own pace, analyze samples, find loose ends. Who is lying and who is telling the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out if you have what it takes to be a forensic detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for your first case?</p>[/b][/b]", "short_description": "Put on your gloves and enter the crime scene. In this investigation simulator, you will have to solve 9 unique and independent cases full of plot twists. Use drones, robots, and chemical analysis to discover what really happened. Here, you don't shoot the bad guys; you catch them with science.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Catalan<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/1d61bcb5129b2327d0c669a9ea068d1421dbc03e/header.jpg?t=1779963187", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/3c185b400b72434acda051642ed7f480161eb5ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779963187", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4307420/3c185b400b72434acda051642ed7f480161eb5ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779963187", "website": "https://www.jandusoft.com/forensicmeprotocol/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or Mac OS X 10.9.2 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD processor, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 470 GTX or AMD Radeon 6870 HD series card or higher</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operat